@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam NoteFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor #7A7A7A
  ArrowColor #555555
}
title PolyNTU dialog map: trade panel on the Market page (UC-20, includes UC-20a fee)

state "Sign-in prompt" as Guest
state "Form disabled" as Closed
state "Blocked" as Blocked
state "Trade form" as Form
state "Calculating" as Calculating
state "Quote preview" as Quote
state "Quote expired" as Expired
state "Confirming" as Confirming
state "Retrieve receipt" as Pending
state "Receipt" as Receipt

Guest : "Sign in from the top right\nto preview and place a trade"
Closed : the form renders but every control is\ndisabled: "Trading is closed" or "suspended"
Blocked : the form renders disabled with\n"Resolve the pending trade before starting\nanother one. Use Resume trade above."
Form : side (Buy / Sell owned shares)\noutcome, shares (0.001 to 100)
Quote : total cost or proceeds, average price,\n0.25% fee, probability after trade,\nexpiry countdown
Pending : original request and idempotency key\nare saved; "Retry / retrieve receipt"
Receipt : "Trade confirmed", shares, units,\nnew balance, receipt id\nshown above a usable trade form

state choose <<choice>>
[*] --> choose : Market page opens
choose --> Guest : [not signed in]
choose --> Pending : [a saved trade for\nthis market exists]
choose --> Closed : [market not tradable]
choose --> Blocked : [a saved trade for\nanother market exists]
choose --> Form : [otherwise]

Guest --> Form : sign in succeeds
Blocked --> Form : the other trade is settled\non its own Market page ("Resume trade")

Form --> Calculating : "Preview trade"
Calculating --> Quote : quote returned
Calculating --> Form : error shown inline
Quote --> Form : change side, outcome\nor shares (quote discarded)
Quote --> Expired : countdown reaches 0
Quote --> Form : another trader moves the market\n(the held quote is discarded)
Expired --> Calculating : "Preview trade" again
Expired --> Form : change side, outcome or shares
Quote --> Confirming : "Confirm buy / sell"

Confirming --> Receipt : trade committed
Confirming --> Form : rejected (400, 404, 409, 422)\nsaved request cleared,\nre-preview needed
Confirming --> Pending : network or server failure\nrequest kept for retry
Pending --> Confirming : "Retry / retrieve receipt"\n(same key: runs once or\nreturns the existing receipt)
Receipt --> Calculating : "Preview trade"\n(the receipt clears)

legend right
  Green: state in the current build
end legend
@enduml
